---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="MailStudio Standalone: Kennedy Ekanem"
  description="A standalone email campaign designer built for event organizers."
>
  <article class="project-page">
    <a class="back-link" href="/#work">← Back to work</a>

    <header class="project-header">
      <p class="project-meta">Product Engineering · Event communications</p>
      <h1>MailStudio Standalone</h1>
      <p class="project-intro">
        A standalone email campaign designer built for event organizers, letting them
        compose, preview, and send personalized emails without touching code.
      </p>
    </header>

    <figure class="project-image">
      <img src="/images/mailstudio-standalone.png" alt="MailStudio email campaign composer and live preview interface" />
      <figcaption>MailStudio’s campaign composer, recipient import, and live email preview.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <section class="project-copy">
      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>
        MailStudio streamlines the last mile of event communication: turning a generic
        confirmation email into something that feels tailored to each attendee.
      </p>
      <p>
        The tool walks users through a three-step flow: Compose, Recipients, and Send. With a live, real-time preview panel that mirrors exactly what recipients will see.
      </p>

      <h2>Key features</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Rich message composer:</strong> editable subject line, preheader, heading, accent color, and body copy, with a Rich Text/HTML toggle.</li>
        <li><strong>Dynamic personalization tokens:</strong> <code>{'{{first_name}}'}</code>, <code>{'{{name}}'}</code>, and <code>{'{{event}}'}</code> merge fields let one template scale across an attendee list.</li>
        <li><strong>Live preview:</strong> updates as users type, supports recipient spot-checking, and includes desktop and mobile views.</li>
        <li><strong>CSV-based recipient management:</strong> a strict <code>first_name</code>, <code>last_name</code>, and <code>email</code> schema keeps imports predictable.</li>
        <li><strong>Test-and-send workflow:</strong> users can send a test to any address before committing to the full campaign.</li>
        <li><strong>Brand controls:</strong> custom accent color, logo upload or URL, button styling, and footer text keep campaigns on-brand.</li>
      </ul>

      <dl class="details">
        <div><dt>Role</dt><dd>Product engineering</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Built for</dt><dd>enyspacelabs</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Year</dt><dd>2026</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Core flow</dt><dd>Compose → Recipients → Send</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Focus</dt><dd>Personalization, live preview, recipient management, and campaign delivery</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <nav class="project-nav" aria-label="Project navigation">
      <a href="/#work">All projects</a>
      <a href="/projects/dragnet-erp">Next: Dragnet ERP →</a>
    </nav>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .project-page{width:min(100% - 40px,680px);margin:0 auto;padding:64px 0 100px}.project-header{margin-top:72px;padding-bottom:28px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.project-meta{margin:0 0 4px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.project-header h1{margin:0;font:clamp(34px,5vw,46px)/1.15 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.035em}.project-intro{max-width:620px;margin:24px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:17px;line-height:1.7}.project-image{width:100%;margin:38px 0 0;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--img-border);border-radius:10px;background:var(--img-bg)}.project-image img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:4px}.project-image figcaption{margin:12px 0 -12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}.project-copy{margin-top:58px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8}.project-copy h2{margin:48px 0 10px;font:26px/1.3 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.02em}.project-copy h2:first-child{margin-top:0}.project-copy p{margin:0 0 20px;color:var(--muted)}.project-copy ul{margin:8px 0 0;padding-left:22px;color:var(--muted)}.project-copy li{margin:0 0 16px}.project-copy strong{color:var(--text)}.project-copy code{font-size:.82em}.details{margin:50px 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.details div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:130px 1fr;gap:20px;padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.details dt{color:var(--muted);font:10px Mono;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em}.details dd{margin:0;font-size:13px}.project-nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:68px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:13px}.project-nav a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
  @media(max-width:600px){.project-page{padding-top:38px}.project-header{margin-top:48px}.project-header h1{font-size:32px}.project-intro{font-size:15px}.project-image{padding:12px}.project-image figcaption{margin-bottom:-4px}.project-copy{margin-top:44px;font-size:16px}.details div{grid-template-columns:100px 1fr}}
</style>
